 ["Your Veil of Swords now heals you for 4% of your max health (per level) and grants you a dodge chance of 3% (per level) for 5 seconds."] = "Your Velo de Espadas now heals you for 4% of your max health (per level) and grants you a dodge chance of 3% (per level) for 5 seconds.",
 ["Your adaptive punch (ice + ice) now has a 5% (per level) chance to trigger Glacial Palm wich deals damage to the target and all nearby enemies."] = "Tu golpe adaptativo (hielo + hielo) ahora tiene un 5% de probabilidad (por nivel) de activar Glacial Palm, que causa dano al objetivo y a todos los enemigos cercanos.",
 ["Your auto attacks now have a 20% + 1% (per level) chance to grant you Momentum, which increases your attack speed for 1% (per level)  to a maximum of 95% for 4 seconds every time your attacks hit an enemy, this effect last until duration is over. Attacks will refresh the duration of momentum."] = "Tus ataques automaticos tienen un 20% + 1% (por nivel) de probabilidad de otorgarte Impulso, que aumenta tu velocidad de ataque un 1% (por nivel) hasta un maximo del 95% durante 4 segundos cada vez que golpeas a un enemigo. Los ataques renuevan la duracion del Impulso.",
 ["Your fire damage have a 2% chance (per level) to trigger Demolition, Demolition deals aoe physical damage on impact."] = "Tu dano de fuego tiene un 2% de probabilidad (por nivel) de activar Demolicion, que causa dano fisico en aarea al impactar.",
