["Your frost and survival combine. Increases max health by 3% and ice damage by 3% while you have unlocked Frost Barrage and Frozen Rain."] = "Tu escarcha y supervivencia se combinan. Aumenta la vida maxima un 3% y el danio de hielo un 3% mientras tengas desbloqueados Descarga Helada y Lluvia Helada.",
