 ["Cathartic Resonance"] = "Resonancia Catártica",
 ["Channel for 1 second to instantly {gain 3 Focus, #5dade2} stacks. Respects Focus Mastery (up to 6 max)."] = "Canaliza 1 segundo para {ganar 3 cargas de Concentración, #5dade2} al instante. Respeta Maestría de Concentración (hasta 6 máx.).",
