	["Defeat the invasion werewolves in vampiric grounds!"] = "¡Derrota a los hombres lobo de la invasión en los dominios vampíricos!",
	["Close the rift by defeating its spawn!"] = "¡Cierra la grieta derrotando a su prole!",
	["Find scattered historical memories before they fade!"] = "¡Encuentra los recuerdos históricos dispersos antes de que se desvanezcan!",
	["Escort the survivor from the start to the finish!"] = "¡Escolta al superviviente del inicio al final!",
